<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>🦁Leo's English Reader</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Gowun+Dodum&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --sun:#FFD23F;
    --coral:#FF6B6B;
    --sky:#4CC9F0;
    --grass:#6BCB77;
    --grape:#B084F5;
    --tangerine:#FF9F45;
    --ink:#3A2E39;
    --cream:#FFF8EC;
    --card:#FFFFFF;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:'Baloo 2','Gowun Dodum',sans-serif;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, #FFF0C2 0, transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, #CDEBFF 0, transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 90%, #D9F7DD 0, transparent 45%),
      var(--cream);
    color:var(--ink);
    min-height:100vh;
    padding-bottom:60px;
  }
  header{
    text-align:center;
    padding:28px 16px 18px;
  }
  header h1{
    font-size:clamp(30px,7vw,46px);
    margin:0;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:-1px;
    text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #fff, 5px 5px 0 rgba(255,107,107,0.35);
  }
  header p{
    font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);
    font-weight:600;
    color:#7a6a8a;
    margin:8px 0 0;
  }
  .wrap{
    max-width:820px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 16px;
  }

  /* ---------- MENU VIEW ---------- */
  .unit-card{
    background:var(--card);
    border-radius:28px;
    padding:20px 22px;
    margin:18px 0;
    box-shadow:0 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    border:4px solid transparent;
  }
  .unit-card:nth-child(7n+1){border-color:var(--coral);}
  .unit-card:nth-child(7n+2){border-color:var(--sky);}
  .unit-card:nth-child(7n+3){border-color:var(--grass);}
  .unit-card:nth-child(7n+4){border-color:var(--grape);}
  .unit-card:nth-child(7n+5){border-color:var(--tangerine);}
  .unit-card:nth-child(7n+6){border-color:var(--sun);}
  .unit-card:nth-child(7n+7){border-color:var(--coral);}

  .unit-head{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .unit-title{
    font-size:clamp(19px,4vw,24px);
    font-weight:700;
    margin:0;
  }
  .unit-sub{
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    color:#8a7d94;
    margin:2px 0 0;
  }
  .full-btn{
    border:none;
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:10px 18px;
    font-family:inherit;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:15px;
    color:#fff;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--grape),#8b5cf6);
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 #6d3fc9;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .full-btn:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:none;}

  .day-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(64px,1fr));
    gap:10px;
    margin-top:16px;
  }
  .day-btn{
    border:none;
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:12px 4px;
    font-family:inherit;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:16px;
    color:#fff;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    transition:transform .08s;
  }
  .day-btn:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:none;}
  .c0{background:var(--coral);} .c1{background:var(--sky);}
  .c2{background:var(--grass);} .c3{background:var(--grape);}
  .c4{background:var(--tangerine);} .c5{background:#F76E9E;}
  .c6{background:#5AC8FA;}

  /* ---------- DAY / FULL VIEW ---------- */
  .top-bar{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
    margin:20px 0 10px;
  }
  .back-btn{
    border:none;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:#fff;
    font-family:inherit;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:16px;
    padding:10px 18px;
    border-radius:999px;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 #1c1620;
  }
  .back-btn:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:none;}
  .view-title{
    font-size:clamp(20px,4.5vw,28px);
    font-weight:800;
    margin:0;
  }
  .hint{
    text-align:center;
    font-weight:600;
    color:#8a7d94;
    font-size:15px;
    margin:6px 0 20px;
  }

  .sentence-card{
    background:var(--card);
    border-radius:22px;
    padding:18px 20px;
    margin:14px 0;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    border:3px solid #f1e9d8;
    transition:transform .06s, border-color .15s;
    position:relative;
  }
  .sentence-card:active{transform:scale(0.98);}
  .sentence-card.playing{border-color:var(--sky);}
  .sentence-row{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:14px;
  }
  .speaker{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    width:42px;height:42px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sky),#2f9fd1);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:20px;
    color:#fff;
    box-shadow:0 3px 0 #1c7ba3;
  }
  .en-text{
    font-size:clamp(18px,4.2vw,23px);
    font-weight:600;
    line-height:1.4;
  }
  .kr-text{
    display:none;
    margin-top:12px;
    padding-top:12px;
    border-top:2px dashed #e5d9c3;
    font-family:'Gowun Dodum',sans-serif;
    font-size:clamp(16px,3.8vw,20px);
    color:#5b4a68;
    font-weight:400;
  }
  .kr-text.show{display:block;}

  .para-card{
    background:var(--card);
    border-radius:22px;
    padding:20px 22px;
    margin:16px 0;
    box-shadow:0 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    border:3px solid #f1e9d8;
  }
  .para-top{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:14px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .play-btn{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    border:none;
    width:48px;height:48px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--grass),#3fae52);
    color:#fff;
    font-size:20px;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 #2c8a3c;
  }
  .play-btn:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:none;}
  .para-text{
    font-size:clamp(17px,3.8vw,20px);
    line-height:1.7;
    font-weight:500;
    white-space:pre-line;
  }

  footer{
    text-align:center;
    color:#a595ae;
    font-size:13px;
    margin-top:40px;
  }
  ::selection{background:#FFE28A;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>🦁Leo's English Reader</h1>
  <p>날짜(Day)를 눌러 문장을 읽고 들어봐요! 🎧</p>
</header>
<div class="wrap" id="app"></div>
<footer>문장을 누르면 발음이 나오고, 한 번 더 누르면 뜻이 보여요 🌈</footer>

